            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.118</h2><ul><li>Keeps the phone pairing QR compact by serving the full setup payload through the protected bridge endpoint instead of embedding oversized secrets directly in the QR code.</li><li>Uses the public watch/bridge URL as a compact setup fallback when Tailscale Serve is missing or stale.</li><li>Preserves full manual setup JSON for troubleshooting while keeping the QR import path small enough for reliable scanning.</li></ul>
]]></description>
